1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,110
Every morning, this whole city runs for the train.

2
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:04,460
Hold the door!

3
00:00:06,347 --> 00:00:07,947
Me? I don't run.

4
00:00:07,950 --> 00:00:12,030
I wear Headway. My next Caltrain, live, right before my eyes.

5
00:00:12,150 --> 00:00:15,650
One swipe of my ring, and I see every train after it.

6
00:00:16,050 --> 00:00:19,590
Late? Cancelled? Time to go? My phone taps me first.

7
00:00:19,850 --> 00:00:21,970
It even taps me before my stop.

8
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:26,400
Oh no! Wait! Stop the train! Let me off!

9
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:27,450
Bye, Max!

10
00:00:27,450 --> 00:00:30,130
Headway. Your next Caltrain, at a glance.
